            "review_title": "Review at Tanh Tach - Seafood Society",
            "review_text": "M.A\nFrederiksberg, Denmark2 contributions\n0\nMediocre experience\nDec 2023 • Couples\nWe went on the 31st of December for a dinner on New Years eve. From outside, the place looks cozy and the same goes for the location itself. However, that is as far as it goes.\nFood is very mediocre and the prices are in the higher end vs. what you get.\nFurthermore, for these prices you would assume service would make up for this. The service, on the other hand, is very poor. \nAll in all I would not recommend Tanh Tach and I am very confused how it has had a mention in the Michelin guide. Street food would have been preferred.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 4, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
