            "review_title": "Review at Tanh Tach - Seafood Society",
            "review_text": "Alan Y\nSeattle, Washington9 contributions\n0\nDelicious and creative\nNov 2023 • Family\nOur dine here was fantastic, full stop! The plate portions are small, and it would benefit you to order several to share with your party. The dishes were creative and flavors well-balanced.\n\nThe service was fantastic, and the dishes were timed appropriately. I enjoyed the desserts very much too; they were not too sweet and very delicate. \n\nThe dining room was completely empty when we arrived, which I thought was a true shame.\n\nAlthough the cuisine is not Vietnamese, this was one of the best places I dined at during my two week trip in the country. I highly recommend it.\nRead more\nWritten November 27, 2023",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
