            "review_text": "Thuong Nguyen\n6 contributions\n0\nBest fusion restaurant in town\nFeb 2023\nI love love this place! Our family was celebrating my mom's birthday here. I had such a great experience with the food here. I recommend the lobster roll, iberico, bone marrow and the black Angus! Would definitely try out again, not only because of the food, but also for the friendly, professional staff. Perfect for family gathering, birthday parties. Very impressive about the decoration. \n\nOne thing I want them to improve is the music background. It was quite loud and wasn't suitable for a elegant place like this.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten March 16, 2023",
