            "review_text": "Daniel H\n1 contribution\n0\nOne of the best restaurant experiences in Hanoi\nNov 2020\nI decided to give myself a treat and decided to eat at Tan Tach Seafood Society. It's a very nice setting. Like a stylish French bistro. The service was very friendly and I ordered a salmon main course with a kale salad. The salmon was fresh and perfectly cooked. I really enjoyed it. The kale salad was also perfectly prepared. I will definitely return to this restaurant when I'm in the mood to treat myself to a great meal.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten January 9, 2021",
