            "review_text": "HK_Traveller05\nLondon, United Kingdom639 contributions\n0\nRoom for improvements\nFeb 2020\nI think the restaurant has a lot of potential if the service could be improved. The location is amazing. The menu was good, but some dishes were not available on the day. When they take out the availability of special dishes, the rest of the menu becomes a bit simple for the concept. Drinks took forever to serve and refill. Overall the food is good enough to recommend, but as a new restaurant more training is needed.\nRead more\nWritten February 17, 2020",
